  rulesText: 'Fire deals 2x damage to Dark cards. Dark deals 1x damage to Fire.

    Babi
    line: Pak Karta > Babi Ngepet > Siluman Babi. Pak Karta needs Mbok Sumi on the
    bench for the first step.

    Each turn: draw one card and gain one energy.

    Maximum
    10 energy; extra energy is lost. Maximum 10 cards in hand; extra draws are discarded.

    Attacks
    and retreats cost energy. Knock out a card to score.

    First to 3 points wins.'
